---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../../components/Section.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Join the beta"
  description="Sign up for the WalkieTokki beta — bring a friend"
>
  <Section>
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-10">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-accent text-[12px] font-medium tracking-tight mb-6">
        Now in beta
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-[32px] md:text-[40px] font-bold tracking-tighter mb-4 leading-tight">
        Bring a friend you'd love to ride with
      </h1>
      <p class="text-text-secondary text-[15px] md:text-[16px] leading-body">
        WalkieTokki shines when you're not riding alone.<br class="hidden sm:block" />
        We'd love it if you signed up with someone you actually ride with.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-10">
      <div class="bg-bg-secondary border border-border rounded-card p-5 text-center">
        <div class="text-[24px] font-bold text-accent mb-1">One month</div>
        <div class="text-[13px] text-text-secondary leading-snug">Full Pro features, free</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-bg-secondary border border-border rounded-card p-5 text-center">
        <div class="text-[24px] font-bold text-accent mb-1">iOS + Galaxy</div>
        <div class="text-[13px] text-text-secondary leading-snug">Both platforms in parallel</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-bg-secondary border border-border rounded-card p-5 text-center">
        <div class="text-[24px] font-bold text-accent mb-1">3 days</div>
        <div class="text-[13px] text-text-secondary leading-snug">Review + invite sent</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto bg-bg-secondary border border-border rounded-card overflow-hidden">
      <iframe
        src="https://tally.so/r/7RpyVL?transparentBackground=1"
        width="100%"
        height="780"
        frameborder="0"
        title="WalkieTokki beta signup"
        loading="lazy"
        class="block bg-transparent"
      ></iframe>
    </div>

    <p class="text-center text-text-tertiary text-[13px] mt-8 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-body">
      The information you share is used only for beta operations<br class="hidden sm:block" />
      and is discarded after the beta ends.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section size="md">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-bg-secondary border border-border rounded-card p-7 md:p-8">
      <h2 class="text-[18px] md:text-[20px] font-semibold mb-4">What the beta looks like</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-text-secondary text-[14px] leading-body">
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent shrink-0">•</span><span><strong class="text-text-primary">Timeline.</strong> The beta runs up to public launch. Exact end date depends on billing verification.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent shrink-0">•</span><span><strong class="text-text-primary">Gear.</strong> A bike + a Bluetooth headset with a mic. Shokz, AirPods Pro, or any bone-conduction headset.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent shrink-0">•</span><span><strong class="text-text-primary">Data.</strong> Voice is never stored. Ride history (time/channel/nickname) is shown on your phone for 30 days.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent shrink-0">•</span><span><strong class="text-text-primary">After the beta?</strong> Continue with Pro, or auto-fall back to Free (3 hrs/week).</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-accent shrink-0">•</span><span><strong class="text-text-primary">Bug reports?</strong> In-app Settings → Contact, or <a href="mailto:support@walkietokki.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">support@walkietokki.com</a>. We reply within 1–3 business days.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
